[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 23.36,
    "text": "Settle into a comfortable position, letting the body find its natural shape for the night."
  },
  {
    "start": 30.0,
    "end": 56.72,
    "text": "No effort, just a gentle arrival."
  },
  {
    "start": 56.72,
    "end": 69.84,
    "text": "Allow your breath to move softly."
  },
  {
    "start": 69.84,
    "end": 77.96,
    "text": "A slow inhale, a long easy exhale."
  },
  {
    "start": 99.84,
    "end": 119.66,
    "text": "With each breath, you enter a calmer rhythm, a slower rhythm, a rhythm that welcomes you"
  },
  {
    "start": 119.66,
    "end": 131.0,
    "text": "Into rest."
  },
  {
    "start": 131.0,
    "end": 146.1,
    "text": "Feel the body relaxing downward into support."
  },
  {
    "start": 146.1,
    "end": 161.28,
    "text": "Let the shoulders release."
  },
  {
    "start": 161.28,
    "end": 190.36,
    "text": "Let the jaw loosen, let the back soften."
  },
  {
    "start": 190.36,
    "end": 218.56,
    "text": "As the muscles settle into stillness, allow the day to drift away behind you, like a distant"
  },
  {
    "start": 218.56,
    "end": 231.62,
    "text": "Shoreline."
  },
  {
    "start": 231.62,
    "end": 244.58,
    "text": "You no longer need to reach."
  },
  {
    "start": 244.58,
    "end": 271.82,
    "text": "Feel the breath flowing through you, and notice how your inner world becomes more open."
  },
  {
    "start": 271.82,
    "end": 293.5,
    "text": "There is a gentle spaciousness forming around you now that welcomes your awareness inward."
  },
  {
    "start": 293.5,
    "end": 309.88,
    "text": "Allow this spaciousness to expand around your body, you may begin to sense yourself floating"
  },
  {
    "start": 309.88,
    "end": 335.4,
    "text": "Slightly, just suspended,"
  },
  {
    "start": 335.4,
    "end": 364.44,
    "text": "In a field of quiet rest, the arms feel light."
  },
  {
    "start": 364.44,
    "end": 379.44,
    "text": "The legs feel light."
  },
  {
    "start": 379.44,
    "end": 393.16,
    "text": "The whole body feels softly anchored."
  },
  {
    "start": 393.16,
    "end": 411.16,
    "text": "The awareness gently lifts and expands."
  },
  {
    "start": 411.16,
    "end": 424.84,
    "text": "This is the beginning of weightlessness."
  },
  {
    "start": 424.84,
    "end": 441.84,
    "text": "Let your breath guide you deeper into it"
  },
  {
    "start": 441.84,
    "end": 466.66,
    "text": "A slow inhale, a long releasing exhale, and you drift a little further into the quiet"
  },
  {
    "start": 466.66,
    "end": 485.74,
    "text": "Space between waking and sleep."
  },
  {
    "start": 485.74,
    "end": 507.62,
    "text": "Loosen and dissolve into the background."
  },
  {
    "start": 507.62,
    "end": 526.74,
    "text": "Every exhale creates more distance between you and the momentum of the day."
  },
  {
    "start": 526.74,
    "end": 556.26,
    "text": "You are drifting now."
  },
  {
    "start": 556.26,
    "end": 579.48,
    "text": "Light, calm, unbound by effort."
  },
  {
    "start": 579.48,
    "end": 606.54,
    "text": "Allow the breath to soften even more."
  },
  {
    "start": 606.54,
    "end": 628.86,
    "text": "Allow the space around you to widen."
  },
  {
    "start": 628.86,
    "end": 631.38,
    "text": "Allow your awareness to float gently."
  },
  {
    "start": 658.86,
    "end": 663.42,
    "text": "Here, everything feels spacious."
  },
  {
    "start": 688.86,
    "end": 693.34,
    "text": "Steady."
  },
  {
    "start": 693.34,
    "end": 707.14,
    "text": "Quiet."
  },
  {
    "start": 718.86,
    "end": 741.66,
    "text": "You are held within a soft sanctuary of sound sleep that feels open and endlessly gentle."
  },
  {
    "start": 748.86,
    "end": 762.84,
    "text": "Each breath draws you deeper."
  },
  {
    "start": 762.84,
    "end": 783.3,
    "text": "This floating rest."
  },
  {
    "start": 783.3,
    "end": 801.92,
    "text": "You become lighter."
  },
  {
    "start": 801.92,
    "end": 822.96,
    "text": "Your mind grows quieter."
  },
  {
    "start": 822.96,
    "end": 844.36,
    "text": "You drift further into ease."
  },
  {
    "start": 844.36,
    "end": 870.36,
    "text": "Your awareness expands, like a slow glow in the distance."
  },
  {
    "start": 870.36,
    "end": 895.42,
    "text": "A calm radiance that wraps softly around you."
  },
  {
    "start": 895.42,
    "end": 914.6,
    "text": "Nothing to reach."
  },
  {
    "start": 914.6,
    "end": 936.6,
    "text": "Just drifting."
  },
  {
    "start": 944.6,
    "end": 959.32,
    "text": "Floating."
  },
  {
    "start": 974.6,
    "end": 1003.08,
    "text": "Resting in a weightless calm."
  },
  {
    "start": 1003.08,
    "end": 1030.72,
    "text": "Let the inner space open."
  },
  {
    "start": 1030.72,
    "end": 1056.72,
    "text": "Let your body sink into support."
  },
  {
    "start": 1056.72,
    "end": 1078.58,
    "text": "Holding in gentle suspension."
  },
  {
    "start": 1078.58,
    "end": 1097.0,
    "text": "You are safe here."
  },
  {
    "start": 1097.0,
    "end": 1115.9,
    "text": "You are supported."
  },
  {
    "start": 1115.9,
    "end": 1139.04,
    "text": "You are carried by rest."
  },
  {
    "start": 1139.04,
    "end": 1161.48,
    "text": "The boundary between thought and dream grows soft."
  },
  {
    "start": 1161.48,
    "end": 1179.66,
    "text": "You drift."
  },
  {
    "start": 1179.66,
    "end": 1196.8,
    "text": "You float."
  },
  {
    "start": 1196.8,
    "end": 1217.04,
    "text": "You dissolve into stillness."
  },
  {
    "start": 1217.04,
    "end": 1238.16,
    "text": "The night holds you with steady presence."
  },
  {
    "start": 1238.16,
    "end": 1257.8,
    "text": "Your breath guides you into deeper rest."
  },
  {
    "start": 1257.8,
    "end": 1278.04,
    "text": "The weightless field surrounds you completely."
  },
  {
    "start": 1278.04,
    "end": 1296.94,
    "text": "You may drift now, softly."
  },
  {
    "start": 1308.04,
    "end": 1324.96,
    "text": "Quietly"
  },
  {
    "start": 1324.96,
    "end": 1345.62,
    "text": "Into deep natural sleep."
  },
  {
    "start": 1345.62,
    "end": 1364.72,
    "text": "The breath slows."
  },
  {
    "start": 1364.72,
    "end": 1387.34,
    "text": "The body settles."
  },
  {
    "start": 1387.34,
    "end": 1411.24,
    "text": "Fades into the dark"
  },
  {
    "start": 1411.24,
    "end": 1435.7,
    "text": "And becomes part of the quiet itself."
  }
]
